  {
    "find": "Claude Code opens the files with its Read tool, which displays images and PDFs and handles large photos itself, so nothing is sent inline.",
    "replace": "Claude Code opens the files with its Read tool. The Read tool displays images and PDFs and handles large photos itself, so nothing is sent inline.",
